@gen.user.profile.lexicon core.note
    text="Word lists for the profile world. The union lexicon of roles is the concatenation of the per-field role lexicons; keep them in step when editing (tests check it). Interests, tools and skills are used by patterns and by ops.mjs through ctx.lexicon."
    core.source="specs/12-profile.md"

